"""A minimal single-stroke CAD font (SHX-style).

Real CAD exporters frequently emit annotation text as stroked polylines with
no text layer at all.  The fixture drawings use this font so that the glyph
reconstruction stage is genuinely exercised rather than short-circuited by
``page.get_text()``.

Glyph space: x in [0, width], y in [0, 7] with the baseline at y = 0.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

